<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3. </span>LLM Reasoning output examples</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ A.3. LLM Reasoning output examples ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Combining Evidence and Reasoning for Biomedical Fact-Checking" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> and <a href="#A1.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ A.3. LLM Reasoning output examples ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Combining Evidence and Reasoning for Biomedical Fact-Checking" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> show additional examples of LLM Reasoning outputs on claims extracted from HealthFC and BioASQ-7b, respectively.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T10" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A1.T10.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:195.2pt;height:117.5pt;vertical-align:-57.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-41.8pt,25.2pt) scale(0.7,0.7) ;">
